//!
//! The faces keep their own terms, and this library's are not theirs:
//! [`LICENCES`] holds the text that covers every family here, and the
//! record of what was vendored. `write_to` writes them beside the faces,
//! because the SIL Open Font License requires its text to travel with
//! the fonts.

